      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does an empty allowlist mean? Does it indicate that the plugin has no external dependencies? In that case, would a dependency test still make sense, or am I overlooking something?\n\nWhich plugin did you use to reproduce this?",
      "revId": "b645a9a8e00e5d3842064d02f79afdd024601112",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
